<p slot="how-to">Read the scope, then the empty reference tables. Status labels describe future sourced entries; blank tables make no claims.</p>
<div slot="body"><EmptyTable columns={["Platform", "How to get MW4", "Notes", "Status"]} caption="Platform and purchase entries" /><h3>FAQ</h3><EmptyTable columns={["Q", "A", "Status", "Last verified"]} caption="Questions and answers awaiting sources" /><h3>Related guides</h3><ul class="cards"><li><a href="/early-access-mw4/">MW4 Early Access</a></li></ul></div>
</GuideLayout>
